144
00:10:06.857 --> 00:10:07.941
-Cash!
-[Cash] Sir.

145
00:10:08.025 --> 00:10:09.985
-Get over here.
-[Ramirez] Anybody seen Miller?

146
00:10:10.485 --> 00:10:12.696
-Yes. sir.
-We're gonna get you treated.

147
00:10:13.196 --> 00:10:15.800
You're going back with the colonel.
