149
00:10:17.159 --> 00:10:18.827
Congratulations.

150
00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.663
To hell with that. sir.
We're nowhere near done here.

151
00:10:22.164 --> 00:10:23.749
Well. you are.

152
00:10:23.832 --> 00:10:25.352
This is a horrible time to leave. sir.

153
00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:26.626
The company needs me.

154
00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.920
Yeah. Well. I guess
we'll just have to win the war

155
00:10:29.004 --> 00:10:30.172
without you then.

156
00:10:30.255 --> 00:10:31.295
Probably faster. actually.

157
00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.134
Yeah. Cash. You're the unit
egg ball anyway. [chuckles]

158
00:10:34.217 --> 00:10:36.219
Remind me who you are again. green boy.

159
00:10:37.387 --> 00:10:39.097
And you burn the Lucky Strike logo first.

160
00:10:39.181 --> 00:10:40.682
Yeah. yeah. all right.

161
00:10:41.933 --> 00:10:43.602
-Sir.
-Hmm.

162
00:10:43.685 --> 00:10:45.145
Captain Castle.

163
00:10:45.228 --> 00:10:47.606
everybody knows that
you qualified for deferment.

164
00:10:48.523 --> 00:10:49.608
