167
00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:56.198
Hmm. right. truth. justice.
and the American way.

168
00:10:56.281 --> 00:10:58.075
Exactly. we're both here to do our part.

169
00:10:58.158 --> 00:10:59.159
Right.

170
00:11:00.118 --> 00:11:03.288
You lost three fingers. Cash.
so you're going to the hospital.

171
00:11:03.372 --> 00:11:06.041
