175
00:11:14.383 --> 00:11:16.843
It's so cold. I think
my nuts fell off two miles back.

176
00:11:16.927 --> 00:11:18.136
Yeah. you're telling me.

177
00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.722
Uh. what's Charlie Company's status?

178
00:11:20.806 --> 00:11:22.849
We have full sections
and individual engineers

179
00:11:22.933 --> 00:11:25.268
