where they can.

180
00:11:25.352 --> 00:11:27.437
I also got some guys on the front line.

181
00:11:27.521 --> 00:11:29.415
Other than that. we're
pretty much ready to roll.

182
00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:32.279
All right. well. we got Able and Baker
already out there with their M1s.

183
00:11:32.359 --> 00:11:33.759
