184
00:11:33.819 --> 00:11:34.979
Okay. guys. get the maps out.

185
00:11:35.028 --> 00:11:36.571
[Top] Hey. Ram. grab our maps.

186
00:11:36.655 --> 00:11:38.156
-Moving. Top.
-[explosion]

187
00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:40.134
-[Ramirez] Here you are. sir.
-If there's one thing

188
00:11:40.158 --> 00:11:42.411
