189
00:11:42.494 --> 00:11:44.913
-Yeah.
-All right. Aventi. turn Lassie off.

190
00:11:44.996 --> 00:11:46.039
Yes. sir.

191
00:11:47.666 --> 00:11:48.500
[music stops]

192
00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:50.836
All right. no time for small talk.

193
00:11:50.919 --> 00:11:55.465
This road here between
Lanzerath and Elsenborn.

194
00:11:55.549 --> 00:11:59.052
now that's about what.
five miles from here. would you say?

195
00:11:59.136 --> 00:12:00.387
Seems right. sir.

196
00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.639
I know it. sir.
Yeah. it's a little under that. maybe.

197
00:12:02.722 --> 00:12:06.476
Okay. well. we need you to
block that road this morning.

198
00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:07.894
All right?

199
00:12:07.978 --> 00:12:10.272
German counteroffensive has
been going on for three days.

200
00:12:10.355 --> 00:12:11.815
and it is massive.

201
00:12:11.898 --> 00:12:13.150
Hitler's probably jacking off

202
00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:15.393
because he's running the same
game plan in the Ardennes

203
00:12:15.444 --> 00:12:18.196
that he ran four years ago.
and it's working. again.

204
00:12:18.697 --> 00:12:20.365
But we're not gonna let the Fuhrer

205
00:12:20.449 --> 00:12:22.492
have the glory. all right?

206
00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.911
We're gonna stop these bastards down

207
00:12:24.995 --> 00:12:28.457
and make sure they get
nowhere near our fuel depots.

208
00:12:28.957 --> 00:12:30.083
There's one more thing.

209
00:12:32.085 --> 00:12:34.713
It's the 1st SS Panzer-Division
coming down that road.

210
00:12:34.796 --> 00:12:35.922
