211
00:12:36.006 --> 00:12:37.883
Used to be Hitler's bodyguards.

212
00:12:37.966 --> 00:12:38.967
The worst of the worst.

213
00:12:39.968 --> 00:12:42.679
You boys have never fought
anything like them. all right?

214
00:12:42.762 --> 00:12:44.681
No one in the 99th has.
I can promise you that.

215
00:12:44.764 --> 00:12:46.641
Right. now. these guys. they are not...

216
00:12:47.642 --> 00:12:50.312
