put their arms up.

220
00:12:58.153 --> 00:12:59.797
and the SS lined them up
and mowed 'em down

221
00:12:59.821 --> 00:13:01.448
right there on the spot. just like that.

222
00:13:01.531 --> 00:13:02.365
Jesus.

223
00:13:02.449 --> 00:13:04.534
And that has been happening nonstop.

224
00:13:04.618 --> 00:13:08.580
So when it comes to the SS.
there are no rules.

225
00:13:08.663 --> 00:13:09.956
There is no international law.

226
00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.767
You get the chance.
you take these fuckers out.

227
00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:14.085
-Am I understood?
-[group] Yes. sir.

228
00:13:14.169 --> 00:13:15.438
And these monsters.
they actually brand themselves

229
00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:17.172
