to set it up. give or take.

236
00:13:31.269 --> 00:13:32.437
I'm taking.

237
00:13:32.938 --> 00:13:34.022
Okay.

238
00:13:34.731 --> 00:13:36.900
-[explosion]
-Okay. all right.

239
00:13:36.983 --> 00:13:38.443
Fantastic.

240
00:13:38.527 --> 00:13:40.129
Let's get it done. boys.
Let's see what you can do.

241
00:13:40.153 --> 00:13:41.363
[Top] Yes. sir.

242
00:13:44.199 --> 00:13:45.700
Cash. where are you?

243
00:13:46.576 --> 00:13:47.827
Sir.

244
00:13:48.662 --> 00:13:50.306
