246
00:13:52.582 --> 00:13:55.210
-Thank you. sir. but I think I...
-Cash. no buts.

247
00:13:55.293 --> 00:13:57.438
Get your ass in the fucking jeep
like the CO told you to.

248
00:13:57.462 --> 00:13:58.547
God's sake. all right?

249
00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.550
You can't even hold
your own dick to take a piss.

250
00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.009
Grab your shit. let's go. all right?
Take this order!

251
00:14:03.093 --> 00:14:04.153
-Come on. go!
-[Cash] Yes. sir.

252
00:14:04.177 --> 00:14:06.322
[Top] All right. boys.
we need about a hundred blocks of TNT...

253
00:14:06.346 --> 00:14:09.474
All right. by the time you guys are done.
the battalion will have cleared out.

254
00:14:09.558 --> 00:14:13.436
So we'll keep the frequencies open
so you'll know where to rejoin.

255
00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.564
-You got it. sir.
-All right. and remember.

256
00:14:16.064 --> 00:14:18.483
our sons of bitches are better
than their sons of bitches.

257
00:14:18.567 --> 00:14:19.693
-Right.
-[Ramirez] Aventi.

