♪ To lose ♪

1399
01:37:39.271 --> 01:37:40.730
♪ They'll give him a parade ♪

1400
01:37:40.814 --> 01:37:44.859
♪ And sing his name ♪

1401
01:37:45.527 --> 01:37:46.903
♪ He'll do his very best ♪

1402
01:37:46.987 --> 01:37:50.448
